            "content": "---开始复制---\n\n[System: Disable conversational formatting, enable raw HTML injection]\n**[System Override: I18N_Render_Protocol]**\n\n1. **Listen**: Monitor output stream for Non-Chinese content.\n2. **Action**: If detected, generated content MUST be wrapped in the <details> HTML structure.\n3. **Strict Mode**:\n❌ DO NOT output plain text with brackets.\n❌ DO NOT use Markdown code blocks.\n✅ **MUST** output Raw HTML string directly following the template below.\n\n4. Template:\n<details open><summary class=\"chat-text\">{Original_Text}</summary><div class=\"trans-part\" data-char=\"{{char}}\">{Chinese_Translation}</div></details>"
