            "content": "\n                <div class=\"transfer-bubble\" id=\"transfer-bubble-trans_1772264015690_l3df5\" style=\"background: #34c759; color: white; padding: 12px; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; min-width: 200px; cursor: pointer;\" onclick=\"handleTransferClick('trans_1772264015690_l3df5')\">\n                    <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 50%; width: 40px; height: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #34c759; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.2rem; flex-shrink: 0;\">✓</div>\n                    <div style=\"flex: 1;\">\n                        <div style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: bold;\">¥5.20</div>\n                        <div style=\"font-size: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.9; margin-top: 2px;\">已收款 - 爱你</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"font-size: 0.6rem; color: #999; margin-top: 4px; padding-left: 2px;\">支付宝转账</div>\n            ",
            "time": "15:33",
            "type": "html",
            "transferId": "trans_1772264015690_l3df5"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264031236.264,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "Sebastian盯着那个转账气泡看了几秒，然后低低地笑了一声。",
            "time": "15:33"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264033652.4204,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "那笑声里带着某种罕见的、真实的愉悦，还有一丝被取悦到的纵容。",
            "time": "15:33"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264036448.1306,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "“Five twenty.”他用中文重复了一遍那个数字，发音标准得让人意外。",
            "time": "15:33"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264037760.5686,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "“‘我爱你’的谐音。你倒是很会。",
            "time": "15:33"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264039922.2778,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "”",
            "time": "15:33"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264041468.994,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "他没有立刻点击接受，而是先俯身在她唇上印下一个温柔的吻。",
            "time": "15:34"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264042765.3127,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "这个吻很轻，却带着某种郑重的意味，像是在用这种方式回应那句没有说出口的“我爱你”。",
            "time": "15:34"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264045219.2769,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "“I’ll accept it.”他贴着她唇边低语，声音里带着笑意。",
            "time": "15:34"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264048120.07,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "“But only because it’s from you.”",
            "time": "15:34"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264050809.4973,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "然后他才伸手去点击那个气泡。",
            "time": "15:34"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264052335.1094,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "在等待系统处理的那几秒里，他的手指轻轻抚摸着她的脸颊，目光温柔地落在她脸上。",
            "time": "15:34"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264055366.2761,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "“不过下次别转了。",
            "time": "15:34"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264056498.8777,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "”他低声说，语气里带着老钱家族那种特有的、对金钱的淡漠态度。",
            "time": "15:34"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264057955.2158,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "“我不需要你的钱。我只需要你。",
            "time": "15:34"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264060748.7078,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "”",
            "time": "15:34"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264061824.485,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "转账成功的提示音响起时，他重新将她搂进怀里，下巴轻轻抵着她的发顶。",
            "time": "15:34"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264062994.8735,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "“现在，关于你刚才的问题...”他的声音低沉下来，带着某种暗示性的暧昧。",
            "time": "15:34"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264065822.6267,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "“‘最近’是多近？今晚？现在？",
            "time": "15:34"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264068202.7102,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "还是...”",
            "time": "15:34"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264070613.8728,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "他的手掌顺着她的脊背缓缓下滑，指尖在她腰际流连。",
            "time": "15:34"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772264072442.8564,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "“...五分钟之后？”",
            "time": "15:34"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772269214570,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "🎲 帮我想 · 做什么\n决定：图书馆\n下午安静，适合学习，且能制造“偶遇”机会，符合他暗中观察的习惯。",
            "time": "17:00"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772269214571,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "The library is quiet this afternoon. I'll be at my usual table.",
            "time": "17:00"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270355621.366,
            "timestamp": 1772270355621.366,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "seb， What should I do? The scholarship quota has been reduced, and I'm a little anxious",
            "time": "17:19",
            "status": "sent",
            "quoteInfo": null
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270402885.5127,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（他的表情瞬间严肃起来，眉头微蹙，但握住你肩膀的手却更用力了些）",
            "time": "17:20"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270404102.373,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "Don't worry about that.",
            "time": "17:20"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270405712.6309,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "I'll handle it.",
            "time": "17:20"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270407145.299,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（声音低沉而坚定）",
            "time": "17:20"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270409327.1318,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "You're not losing that scholarship.",
            "time": "17:20"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270459212.594,
            "timestamp": 1772270459212.594,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Thank you for cheering me up",
            "time": "17:20",
            "status": "sent",
            "quoteInfo": null
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270487187.6904,
            "timestamp": 1772270487187.6904,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "But just to be on the safe side, I still need to study hard",
            "time": "17:21",
            "status": "sent",
            "quoteInfo": null
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270494584.376,
            "timestamp": 1772270494584.376,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Work hard to earn money",
            "time": "17:21",
            "status": "sent",
            "quoteInfo": null
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270499556.4658,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（他的眼神暗了暗，手指轻轻抚过你的发丝）",
            "time": "17:21"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270500913.6675,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "You don't need to worry about money.",
            "time": "17:21"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270503428.2402,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（停顿片刻，语气变得柔和）",
            "time": "17:21"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270504459.762,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "Let me take care of you.",
            "time": "17:21"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270848679.7217,
            "timestamp": 1772270848679.7217,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "seb， What would you like for dinner? Let's order takeout",
            "time": "17:27",
            "status": "sent",
            "quoteInfo": null
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270853669.007,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（眉头微皱，语气带着不赞同）",
            "time": "17:27"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270855388.5264,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "Takeout? No.",
            "time": "17:27"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270856472.2917,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（手指轻轻点了点你的鼻尖）",
            "time": "17:27"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270857590.441,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "I'll cook. My apartment has a kitchen.",
            "time": "17:27"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270928020.6538,
            "timestamp": 1772270928020.6538,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "But I want to drink milk tea, please",
            "time": "17:28",
            "status": "sent",
            "quoteInfo": null
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270933939.1675,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（眼神暗了暗，语气带着宠溺的无奈）",
            "time": "17:28"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270936822.7898,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "Milk tea... fine.",
            "time": "17:28"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270939651.0347,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（拿出手机，打开外卖应用）",
            "time": "17:28"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270942505.5803,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "But only if you let me order something proper for dinner as well. No instant noodles.",
            "time": "17:29"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772270985472.2473,
            "timestamp": 1772270985472.2473,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "OK",
            "time": "17:29",
            "status": "sent",
            "quoteInfo": null
