          {
            "id": 1772271612307.4321,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（看着更新后的小票，眉头皱得更紧了）",
            "time": "17:40"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271614653.2532,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "128 dollars for two drinks? That's absurd.",
            "time": "17:40"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271617371.3755,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（直接打开自己的手机银行应用，快速操作）",
            "time": "17:40"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271619076.9626,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "You shouldn't be spending that kind of money. Let me handle this.",
            "time": "17:40"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271635880.4873,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（转账成功的提示音响起）",
            "time": "17:40"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271637547.6694,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "There. Now you can order whatever you want without worrying about the price.",
            "time": "17:40"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271640550.71,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（将手机屏幕转向她，显示转账记录）",
            "time": "17:40"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271643196.1523,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "And don't even think about sending it back. Consider it... an investment in my future caffeine supply.",
            "time": "17:40"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271644643.6428,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（语气依然冷淡，但眼神里闪过一丝难以察觉的温柔）",
            "time": "17:40"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271647215.391,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "The black coffee is fine. But next time, let me order. I have a membership at that place.",
            "time": "17:40"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271738246.184,
            "timestamp": 1772271738246.184,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "love you baby",
            "time": "17:42",
            "status": "sent",
            "quoteInfo": null
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271743728.0964,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（手指在手机屏幕上停顿了一下，蓝灰色眼眸微微睁大）",
            "time": "17:42"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271746460.557,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "What did you just say?",
            "time": "17:42"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271748892.284,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（声音比平时低了几度，带着一丝不易察觉的紧张）",
            "time": "17:42"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271751703.1804,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "You're... not drunk, are you?",
            "time": "17:42"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271866292.6494,
            "timestamp": 1772271866292.6494,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "I'm not drunk, thank you for the transfer",
            "time": "17:44",
            "status": "sent",
            "quoteInfo": null
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271875537.411,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（将手机收回口袋，手指无意识地摩挲着表带）",
            "time": "17:44"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271876714.7473,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "You're welcome.",
            "time": "17:44"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772271879593.1682,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（停顿片刻，目光移向窗外）",
