          {
            "id": 1772388789471.1418,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（盯着屏幕上的小票，眉头紧锁）",
            "time": "02:13"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772388791708.3953,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "What is this.",
            "time": "02:13"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772388793246.6074,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（声音冷了下来）",
            "time": "02:13"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772388795853.5442,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "I don't wear Gucci belts.",
            "time": "02:13"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772388834844.2336,
            "timestamp": 1772388834844.2336,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Dear, I'm sorry, I just wanted to give you a gift",
            "time": "02:13",
            "status": "sent",
            "quoteInfo": null
          },
          {
            "id": 1772388857224.3809,
            "timestamp": 1772388857224.3809,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Perhaps you can tell me what brand you usually wear?",
            "time": "02:14",
            "status": "sent",
            "quoteInfo": null
          },
          {
            "id": 1772388862805.0566,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（深吸一口气，手指在屏幕上停顿）",
            "time": "02:14"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772388865671.6016,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "You don't need to buy me anything.",
            "time": "02:14"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772388867611.874,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（语气稍微缓和）",
            "time": "02:14"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772388869422.2498,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "And it's not about the brand. It's... you shouldn't spend money on me.",
            "time": "02:14"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772388953571.3384,
            "timestamp": 1772388953571.3384,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "oh no",
            "time": "02:15",
            "status": "sent",
            "quoteInfo": null
          },
          {
            "id": 1772388989139.6045,
            "timestamp": 1772388989139.6045,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Okay dear, I understand what you mean. But I have already bought this and cannot return it",
            "time": "02:16",
            "status": "sent",
            "quoteInfo": null
          },
          {
            "id": 1772389007681.6821,
            "timestamp": 1772389007681.6821,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "I won't do it again in the future",
            "time": "02:16",
            "status": "sent",
            "quoteInfo": null
          },
          {
            "id": 1772389011997.5994,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（眉头紧皱）",
            "time": "02:16"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772389013344.908,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "What did you buy.",
            "time": "02:16"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772389014447.0293,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "（停顿片刻，语气变得严肃）",
            "time": "02:16"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772389016310.2947,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "Tell me the price. I'll transfer the money to you.",
