            "content": "(He freezes, the words hitting him like a physical blow. His knuckles turn white where he grips the phone)",
            "time": "23:53",
            "type": "chat",
            "source": "main-reply"
          },
          {
            "id": 1772985191899.4795,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "...Tomorrow. (The word comes out choked) I'll come to you after debate practice. Don't... don't say things like that and then just sleep.",
            "time": "23:53",
            "type": "chat",
            "source": "main-reply"
          },
          {
            "id": 1773039266375,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "—— 以下是seb在你离开期间发的消息 ——",
