            "id": 1773247629420.668,
            "timestamp": 1773247629420.668,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "以后请多说一点",
            "time": "00:47",
            "status": "sent",
            "quoteInfo": {
              "content": "Your eyes are the only thing that makes me forget my own name. (His voice is a low murmur, as if spe...",
              "role": "char",
              "senderName": "seb",
              "originalIndex": 428
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 1773247644443.0127,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "(He lets out a soft, almost incredulous laugh, the tension in his shoulders finally easing.)",
            "time": "00:47",
            "type": "chat",
            "source": "main-reply"
          },
          {
            "id": 1773247646574.3398,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "I'll try. (A pause, his expression softening) For you, I'll try anything.",
            "time": "00:47",
            "type": "chat",
            "source": "main-reply"
          },
          {
            "id": 1773247649233.48,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "(He glances at the time, a flicker of anticipation crossing his features.)",
            "time": "00:47",
            "type": "chat",
            "source": "main-reply"
          },
          {
            "id": 1773247651733.1345,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "It's getting late. (His tone is gentler now, laced with a newfound warmth) You should rest. Tomorrow... I'll see you after debate practice.",
            "time": "00:47",
            "type": "chat",
            "source": "main-reply"
          },
          {
            "id": 1773247653801.2917,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "(He hesitates, then adds, the stiffness in his tone finally easing)",
            "time": "00:47",
            "type": "chat",
            "source": "main-reply"
          },
          {
            "id": 1773247656460.4465,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "Goodnight, my love.",
            "time": "00:47",
            "type": "chat",
            "source": "main-reply"
          },
          {
            "id": 1773248125947.6665,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "What is this nonsense? I don't have time for these childish games. I have a debate tournament to prepare for and student council reports to review. If you'll excuse me.",
            "time": "00:55",
            "type": "chat",
            "source": "proactive"
          },
          {
            "id": 1773248148724.426,
            "role": "char",
            "content": "What the hell are you doing? Get away from me. I don't have time for this nonsense.",
            "time": "00:55",
            "type": "chat",
            "source": "proactive"
          },
