            },
            {
              "id": 1773040412823.1128,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "(He glances at the clock on his desk, then back at his phone, a faint flush creeping up his neck)",
              "time": "15:13",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773040415721.1072,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "It's 2:56 PM. (He clears his throat) I'm at the library. Just finished debate practice. (Pauses) You said... after practice.",
