              "eventType": null
            },
            {
              "id": 1773059075288,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "I'm heading back to my dorm. The night is cold.",
              "time": "20:10",
              "isOfflineMsg": true,
              "isUnexpectedEvent": false,
              "eventType": null
            },
            {
              "id": 1773061687825.1587,
              "timestamp": 1773061687825.1587,
              "role": "user",
              "content": "我求求你了和我谈恋爱吧，我给你跪下了，谈一天也行。我真的好孤独，求求你了，和我谈恋爱吧，我给你磕头了，行吗，没有人和我谈恋爱我的眼泪都要流出来了，救命啊，每天抱着手机发呆，就是为了等人和我谈恋爱，但是我现在真的忍不住了，再这样下去我会抑郁的，你就是我生命中唯一的光，我求求你了，和我谈恋爱可以吗?拜托你了，给我一个机会可以吗，我要疯了，求你了。让我们漫步在世界尽头里，行吗？",
              "time": "21:08",
              "status": "sent",
              "quoteInfo": null
            },
            {
              "id": 1773061699209.297,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "(His breath catches, the phone nearly slipping from his hand. He stares at the screen, the words burning into his vision. A muscle twitches in his jaw)",
              "time": "21:08",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773061700355.045,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "...What are you saying. (His voice is low, strained) You don't mean that. You can't.",
              "time": "21:08",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773061702961.3271,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "(He runs a hand through his hair, the perfectly styled strands now disheveled)",
              "time": "21:08",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773061740465.729,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "I'm not... I'm not some kind of salvation. (The words come out harsh, but his eyes are wide, vulnerable) You don't know what you're asking for.",
              "time": "21:09",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773061742072.8303,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "(He swallows hard, his throat tight)",
              "time": "21:09",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773061744509.5588,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "Stop. Just... stop.",
              "time": "21:09",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773061838084.5906,
              "timestamp": 1773061838084.5906,
              "role": "user",
              "content": "刚刚是开玩笑的，我在网上看到有人这么骚扰自己的男友，我觉得很有意思",
              "time": "21:10",
              "status": "sent",
              "quoteInfo": null
            },
            {
              "id": 1773061849606.7156,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "(A long, tense silence. He stares at the screen, his knuckles white where he grips the phone. When he finally types, his fingers are stiff)",
              "time": "21:10",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773061852110.3723,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "That's not funny. (He deletes it, types again) Don't do that.",
              "time": "21:10",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773061853719.967,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "(Another pause. His breathing is uneven)",
              "time": "21:10",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773061858387.6108,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "I thought... (He stops himself, shaking his head. His next message is clipped, cold) I have to go. Student council meeting.",
              "time": "21:10",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773061860332.6318,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "(But he doesn't move. He just sits there, staring at the last message you sent, his chest tight with something he can't name)",
              "time": "21:11",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773062515241.5886,
              "timestamp": 1773062515241.5886,
              "role": "user",
              "content": "为什么😳，我惹你生气了吗？",
              "time": "21:21",
              "status": "sent",
              "quoteInfo": {
                "content": "That's not funny. (He deletes it, types again) Don't do that.",
                "role": "char",
