                "originalIndex": 400
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 1773062528840.421,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "(He stares at your message, the simple question hitting him harder than he expected. His fingers hover over the screen, then type slowly)",
              "time": "21:22",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773062531444.4075,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "No. (A pause) Yes. (Another pause, longer this time) It's not... it's not something to joke about.",
              "time": "21:22",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773062788477.2559,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "(He leans back against his dorm room wall, the cool plaster doing nothing to calm the heat under his skin)",
              "time": "21:26",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773062790455.2815,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "You said you'd be there after debate practice. (His voice is quiet, almost to himself) You promised.",
              "time": "21:26",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773062792603.7986,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "(He closes his eyes briefly, then types again, the words coming out more raw than he intended)",
              "time": "21:26",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773062793861.8564,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "Don't play games with me, Yun. I can't... I can't handle it.",
              "time": "21:26",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773062860450.723,
              "timestamp": 1773062860450.723,
              "role": "user",
              "content": "有点委屈，我没有和你耍花招，我只是在学着调情，你觉得不好，我就不说了，你不要这样子",
              "time": "21:27",
              "status": "sent",
              "quoteInfo": {
                "content": "Don't play games with me, Yun. I can't... I can't handle it.",
