              "content": "(A soft, almost pained laugh escapes him)",
              "time": "21:27",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773062879352.7156,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "God. I'm an idiot. (He types slowly, each word deliberate) I didn't know. I thought... I thought you were mocking me. Or that you'd changed your mind.",
              "time": "21:27",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773062880634.7441,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "(He hesitates, then adds, the stiffness in his tone finally easing)",
              "time": "21:28",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773062882550.5786,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "Don't stop. Just... maybe give me a warning next time. My heart can't take it.",
              "time": "21:28",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773062974219.914,
              "timestamp": 1773062974219.914,
              "role": "user",
              "content": "我怎么会嘲笑你，我爱你啊，你是我的男朋友",
              "time": "21:29",
              "status": "sent",
              "quoteInfo": {
                "content": "God. I'm an idiot. (He types slowly, each word deliberate) I didn't know. I thought... I thought you...",
                "role": "char",
                "senderName": "seb",
