              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773063077348.1887,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "...(A long, shaky exhale) You've never said that before.",
              "time": "21:31",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773063079491.142,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "(His fingers are trembling slightly as he types. The cool, controlled facade is gone, stripped bare by five simple words.)",
              "time": "21:31",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773063082193.3523,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "Say it again. (The request is raw, almost desperate) Please.",
              "time": "21:31",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773063264379.9763,
              "timestamp": 1773063264379.9763,
              "role": "user",
              "content": "seb，我发现虽然你是上位者，但是平时恋爱总是我哄你，你可以和我也说点甜言蜜语吗？",
              "time": "21:34",
              "status": "sent",
              "quoteInfo": null
            },
            {
              "id": 1773063334693.9858,
              "timestamp": 1773063334693.9858,
              "role": "user",
              "content": "我爱你，我的seb，我的爱人，我的宝贝",
              "time": "21:35",
              "status": "sent",
              "quoteInfo": {
                "content": "Say it again. (The request is raw, almost desperate) Please.",
                "role": "char",
                "senderName": "seb",
                "originalIndex": 422
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 1773063348346.8306,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "(He lets out a breath he didn't know he was holding, a soft, shaky sound. The screen glows in the dark dorm room, illuminating the faint, helpless smile on his lips.)",
              "time": "21:35",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773063349662.0325,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "You're right. (He types slowly, each word a deliberate confession) I'm... not good at this. I've spent so long hiding it, even from myself.",
              "time": "21:35",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773063351897.794,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "(He pauses, gathering courage.)",
              "time": "21:35",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773063353306.949,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "Your eyes are the only thing that makes me forget my own name. (His voice is a low murmur, as if speaking to himself) And when you smile... it feels like the sun finally decided to rise just for me.",
