              "time": "00:47",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773247646574.3398,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "I'll try. (A pause, his expression softening) For you, I'll try anything.",
              "time": "00:47",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773247649233.48,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "(He glances at the time, a flicker of anticipation crossing his features.)",
              "time": "00:47",
              "type": "chat",
              "source": "main-reply"
            },
            {
              "id": 1773247651733.1345,
              "role": "char",
              "content": "It's getting late. (His tone is gentler now, laced with a newfound warmth) You should rest. Tomorrow... I'll see you after debate practice.",
