    "qzone": {
      "feedsKey": "qzone-feeds-user-1",
      "feeds": [
        {
          "id": 1772812658239,
          "type": "char",
          "charId": "char-1772204131316",
          "userName": "seb",
          "userAvatar": "",
          "content": "Late night at the library. The silence is a tangible thing, broken only by the turning of pages and the distant hum of the heating system. Finished reviewing the debate case for tomorrow. The emptiness of this place at this hour is... preferable to the noise elsewhere. One more cup of black coffee should suffice.",
          "images": [],
          "location": "",
          "mood": "",
          "time": "2026-03-06T15:57:38.239Z",
          "likes": [
            {
              "charId": "user",
              "charName": "伍韵",
              "charAvatar": "",
              "time": "2026-03-06T16:51:11.818Z"
            }
          ],
          "comments": [],
          "forwards": 0,
          "atChars": []
        },
        {
          "id": 1772686909827,
          "type": "char",
          "charId": "char-1772204131316",
          "userName": "seb",
          "userAvatar": "",
          "content": "Three days of silence. Three days of wondering if she was safe, if she was hurt, if she simply didn't care enough to pick up the phone. The rational part of me knows it was a family obligation, a cultural necessity. The irrational part—the part that keeps a private log of her coffee preferences and hates cilantro on her behalf—is still raw. The library feels emptier. The black coffee tastes more bitter. Control is an illusion when it comes to her. Always has been.",
          "images": [],
          "location": "",
          "mood": "",
          "time": "2026-03-05T05:01:49.827Z",
          "likes": [
            {
              "charId": "user",
              "charName": "伍韵",
              "charAvatar": "",
              "time": "2026-03-06T16:51:14.159Z"
            }
          ],
          "comments": [],
          "forwards": 0,
          "atChars": []
        },
        {
          "id": 1772681071249,
          "type": "user",
          "userId": 1,
          "userName": "伍韵",
          "userAvatar": "",
          "content": "Last night at 8 o'clock, I scheduled an interview on the job search software. After careful consideration, I realized that HR, who still needs to reply to my message at 8 pm, must often work overtime in their company. Therefore, I decided not to attend the interview this morning",
          "images": [],
          "location": "",
          "mood": "",
          "atChars": [],
          "visibility": "public",
          "time": "2026-03-05T03:24:31.250Z",
          "likes": [],
          "comments": [
            {
              "id": 1772681076698,
              "charId": "char-1772204131316",
              "charName": "seb",
              "charAvatar": "",
              "content": "A wise decision. Companies that disrespect work-life balance rarely value their employees.",
              "time": "2026-03-05T03:24:36.698Z"
            }
          ],
          "forwards": 0
        },
        {
          "id": 1772455307440,
          "type": "user",
          "userId": 1,
          "userName": "伍韵",
          "userAvatar": "",
          "content": "It's a very nice bracelet. If it's priced in two digits, I wouldn't hesitate to buy it. Unfortunately, it's not. It's priced in four digits,",
          "images": [
            ""
          ],
          "location": "",
          "mood": "",
          "atChars": [],
          "visibility": "public",
          "time": "2026-03-02T12:41:47.441Z",
          "likes": [],
          "comments": [
            {
              "id": 1772455312441,
              "charId": "char-1772204131316",
              "charName": "seb",
              "charAvatar": "",
              "content": "I'll buy it for you",
              "time": "2026-03-02T12:41:52.441Z"
            }
          ],
          "forwards": 1
        },
        {
          "id": 1772250966827,
          "type": "char",
          "charId": "char-1772204131316",
          "userName": "seb",
          "userAvatar": "",
          "content": "Library until midnight again. The silence is only broken by the turning of pages and the occasional sigh from the corner table. Black coffee has gone cold. Sometimes I wonder if she notices the same things I do—the way the light hits the bookshelves at this hour, the faint scent of old paper and ink. Probably not. She’s too focused on her notes. As she should be.",
          "images": [],
          "location": "",
          "mood": "",
          "time": "2026-02-28T03:56:06.827Z",
          "likes": [
            {
              "charId": "user",
              "charName": "伍韵",
              "charAvatar": "",
              "time": "2026-03-02T12:37:00.850Z"
            }
          ],
          "comments": [],
          "forwards": 0,
          "atChars": []
        },
        {
